WEBVTT

00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:12.833
"Butt Out, Youth" "Large Household of
Wandering Overhead Throws Collection"

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:20.833
♪ I, Koshi Rikdo, give my permission ♪

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:27.250
♪ to turn the Excel Saga anime
into a youth drama. ♪

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:33.833
♪ I give my permission
to turn it into a youth drama! ♪

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:37.542
"I give my permission to turn
Excel Saga into a youth drama."

00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:41.917
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:56.500
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.333
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:08.250
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:16.167
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:23.875
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:28.708
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:32.708
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:36.667
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.875
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:42.125
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:42.125 --> 00:01:44.042
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:45.750
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.792
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:52.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:55.792
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:01:55.792 --> 00:02:00.292
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:02:00.292 --> 00:02:08.125
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:14.583 --> 00:02:19.250
Dirty pictures, dirty pictures!
I hate this!

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:22.083
I shackle the unwilling me!

00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:28.375
But it's no use, because
this is my job! How 'bout it?!

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:30.458
Oh, dirty pictures!

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:31.750
Excel...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.708
Yes, Lord Ilpalazzo?!

00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:39.042
Oh, did I freely dig some hole
in the main artery of your speech?

00:02:39.042 --> 00:02:40.250
Yes, you did.

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.625
And a great big one at that.

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.750
Oops! Please pardon me!

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.000
Well, it's not quite
an apology or anything,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.250
but I, Excel, will put myself
through rock torture and stuff,

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.500
so please forgive me!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.625
Lord Ilpalazzo, please continue
with what you were saying.

00:02:57.625 --> 00:02:58.958
Right.

00:02:59.417 --> 00:03:02.167
The future of this nation is dark!

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:03.958
It's dark! Yay!

00:03:04.792 --> 00:03:08.958
I, Excel, as Lord Ilpalazzo's
number one underling,

00:03:08.958 --> 00:03:12.292
am always working to
realize your honorable ideal

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:17.958
and I jump to the concepts
of effort, friendship, and victory!

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:22.542
Then why is the future
of this nation dark?

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:24.542
Tell me the reason for that in detail.

00:03:24.542 --> 00:03:25.667
D'oh!

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:28.458
I-Is it like that thing?
Where it's always been said that

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:31.750
“You should look at your wife's
umbilical cord three times?”

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.333
--And just like that saying or in America,

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:33.875
--Then Hyatt...
--And just like that saying or in America,

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:34.792
--Then Hyatt...
--though they may say Jimmy has a lot of kids...

00:03:34.792 --> 00:03:36.250
--Yes, Sir. If the future is dark,
--though they may say Jimmy has a lot of kids...

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.667
--perhaps there is a problem
--though they may say Jimmy has a lot of kids...

00:03:37.667 --> 00:03:40.917
with the education of the next generation.

00:03:40.917 --> 00:03:44.500
Exactly. You're quick on
the uptake, Hyatt.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.500
Not at all, I am not
worthy of such praise.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.083
N-N-Next generation?

00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:54.042
And that brings us
to your mission for today.

00:03:54.042 --> 00:03:56.417
What?! No jabs at all?!

00:03:56.417 --> 00:03:58.792
In order to feel out the current
situation of the education scene,

00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:01.292
I want you to infiltrate
a high school as teachers.

00:04:01.292 --> 00:04:02.708
Roger, Sir.

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:04.583
Excel rogers that too!

00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:06.917
I've perfectly rogered it!

00:04:06.917 --> 00:04:11.375
Hyatt, please step
back about 81 centimeters.

00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:13.708
Oh, is it that?

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:15.875
That's right. Today's is long.

00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:20.750
Then I'll be gone for a bit!

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:25.250
If it's just a little bit,
then it's okay! With that thumb...

00:04:28.458 --> 00:04:29.875
Raise my face smoothly and...

00:04:29.875 --> 00:04:35.208
Oh? Isn't this the school that
I was attending in episode one?

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:39.333
High School,
commonly known as Inu High.

00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:42.083
So, this is our workplace this time.

00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:46.250
Oops! Somewhere along the way,
I've changed into a suit too!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.667
This is the true gag anime!

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:52.125
There were absolutely
no odd prearrangements!

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:52.417
--Inu-nabe High School...

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:54.125
--Looking good?! Yeah!
--Inu-nabe High School...

00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:54.542
--Somehow, it's a name that I can sympathize with.

00:04:54.542 --> 00:04:57.542
--Are you doing it?! No!
--Somehow, it's a name that I can sympathize with.

00:04:58.583 --> 00:04:59.917
Right away!

00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:02.625
It's been a while since
I've been to school.

00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:04.125
Brings back some memories.

00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:08.667
You know, the exciting sweet
and sour, lightly salty school life.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:11.250
My, I had no idea that even
you had such memories, Senior.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.375
Well, sure. I'm a girl too.

00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:15.667
If you pat me down, you'll find
some slightly embarrassing dust

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:19.125
or mysterious fluids will come out.

00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:21.125
Such are the memories of youth.

00:05:21.125 --> 00:05:23.458
Oh, please, Hatchan!

00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:28.000
Now, now,
let's hurry up and go, go, go.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.417
W-What the heck?

00:05:29.417 --> 00:05:32.125
But the weather forecast
said it would be a clear day today.

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:34.000
A desk! On top of that,

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.458
"Volvulus"
it's got something written on it.

00:05:37.667 --> 00:05:39.500
I don't get it.

00:05:41.917 --> 00:05:47.500
Well, it's very encouraging when
our alumni come back to teach.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.000
--Oh please, really?!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.625
Hasn't this place changed
quite a bit since you were here?

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:57.125
Once, the prefecture
was known for our school.

00:05:57.125 --> 00:06:00.750
We were a prestigious school
and our name resounded far and wide.

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:03.292
But now, just look
at what it has become.

00:06:03.292 --> 00:06:05.208
Those around us call us
the Stagnant Pool of Education.

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:09.083
They even call us the Dump for
Delinquents and Unburnable Trash.

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:15.292
This place is quite run-down,
but are classes held in all this?

00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:18.167
Classes are nothing but show.

00:06:18.167 --> 00:06:23.125
Well, both of you just be
careful and try not to get hurt.

00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:26.000
Oh, hello. Please excuse us...

00:06:31.792 --> 00:06:34.167
More like a rarity
these days, than scary!

00:06:34.167 --> 00:06:36.500
It looks like a sample fair of delinquents.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.625
Now, today, I'd like to introduce
your student teachers to you.

00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:44.708
I'm Etchan! And this is Hatchan!

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:47.167
Hey, hot!

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:49.250
Say, wanna be my woman?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:52.500
Teacher, let's pretend to be
crazy riders on my used bike

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.333
on Saturday night
and have a hairpin circus!

00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:59.042
I don't understand
what they're saying at all.

00:06:59.042 --> 00:07:02.042
It sort of feels as though
we've traveled through time.

00:07:02.042 --> 00:07:07.125
Well, I'll leave the rest to
you young people, so I'll be going.

00:07:07.125 --> 00:07:09.125
And he just runs off right away.

00:07:10.542 --> 00:07:13.750
People, I don't think we should
thoughtlessly and recklessly

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.583
throw empty cans
and things in the classroom!

00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:20.417
Education is so powerless, isn't it?

00:07:20.417 --> 00:07:24.208
Thirty seconds on the podium
and we already have a conclusion.

00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:26.417
Teacher, let's get class started!

00:07:26.417 --> 00:07:29.083
Yeah! I like stuff like health education!

00:07:29.083 --> 00:07:32.208
Private lessons, if possible!

00:07:32.208 --> 00:07:33.583
You know, all together,

00:07:33.583 --> 00:07:35.958
this class probably
doesn't have an IQ of 100.

00:07:35.958 --> 00:07:37.958
They might not even make double digits.

00:07:37.958 --> 00:07:40.375
What are you muttering about, Teacher?!

00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:43.125
If you're not gonna do anything,
go home! Or else, strip!

00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:45.917
Yeah! Strip, strip!

00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:51.083
Th-That's...

00:07:52.917 --> 00:07:55.583
That's the one thing
you're not supposed to do!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:08.625
"All of you viewers out there, please listen to
this beautiful music instead of the sound effects."

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.292
"Faculty Office"
And so...

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:15.458
The future really is dark.

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:20.083
I too am rather unconfident about
continuing classes in this way.

00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:22.833
Miss Etchan and Miss Hatchan?

00:08:22.833 --> 00:08:24.000
Yes?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.333
I'm Aesop, the sponsor
of the baseball team.

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:29.625
I'm very sorry to trouble you
when we've just met,

00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:31.875
but I have a favor to ask of you two.

00:08:35.917 --> 00:08:39.958
I see. So you want us
to coach the baseball team?

00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:40.583
--Yes.

00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:45.917
--But why? We will be gone in a week.
--Yes.

00:08:45.917 --> 00:08:47.417
I hate to say it this way,

00:08:47.417 --> 00:08:49.500
but the baseball team has been
riddled with violent incidents

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.042
and scandals, and is on the
verge of being dissolved.

00:08:52.042 --> 00:08:55.792
So I've been turned down
by every single other teacher.

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:58.125
The Vice-Principal has given
us a final warning, saying that

00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:00.792
if we lose to Sarutama High School
in the practice game on Sunday,

00:09:00.792 --> 00:09:03.917
we would be formally dissolved.

00:09:03.917 --> 00:09:08.375
But I do not want to allow the
once-veteran team to be squashed.

00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:11.750
I want to take the team to Koshien!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:13.708
There are four days until Sunday.

00:09:13.708 --> 00:09:16.750
Please! Won't you help us?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.833
Can you not do this yourself?

00:09:19.708 --> 00:09:22.833
My body is being ravaged
by an incurable disease.

00:09:22.833 --> 00:09:24.542
An incurable disease?!

00:09:24.542 --> 00:09:25.583
Could it be that...

00:09:25.583 --> 00:09:27.500
...you have sporadic anal
enlargement syndrome

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.375
and the doctors have
already given up on you

00:09:29.375 --> 00:09:32.375
and you can only poop healthily
for another ten months and ten days?

00:09:32.375 --> 00:09:33.917
Bulls eye, shock!

00:09:33.917 --> 00:09:36.042
That was too straightforward!
Too direct!

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:39.167
Couldn't you have said it
a little more slowly and gently?

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:39.625
--In the end... In the end, my anus will be...

00:09:39.625 --> 00:09:41.250
--Oh, boy.
--In the end... In the end, my anus will be...

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.417
Setting that aside...

00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:43.750
And quick to recover too.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.208
The Junior Sunflower Class
was called the rubbish heap of hell,

00:09:47.208 --> 00:09:49.875
but you were able to quiet them
down in just a couple seconds.

00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:53.333
Please! Lend me your help
in rebuilding the baseball team!

00:09:53.333 --> 00:09:55.792
I don't really care, but why here?

00:09:55.792 --> 00:09:58.125
Oh, it's big!

00:09:58.125 --> 00:09:59.792
What is big?

00:09:59.792 --> 00:10:00.792
Don't ask!

00:10:00.792 --> 00:10:02.458
What do you want to
do about the baseball team?

00:10:02.458 --> 00:10:04.792
Well, there are Lord
Ilpalazzo's orders to consider.

00:10:04.792 --> 00:10:06.958
We probably should not
do anything conspicuous.

00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:08.875
And so, Mr. Aesop!

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:10.417
Y-Yes?

00:10:10.417 --> 00:10:12.583
We don't wanna do it after all!

00:10:13.625 --> 00:10:15.417
Well, good luck!

00:10:15.417 --> 00:10:18.167
We will be cheering
you on from the sidelines.

00:10:18.167 --> 00:10:19.583
Please wait.

00:10:20.458 --> 00:10:23.667
I had decided that I would
not use this method,

00:10:23.667 --> 00:10:25.833
but since it's come to this,
I have no choice.

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:29.083
I shall curse the two of you.

00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:31.167
I may not look it, but in college,

00:10:31.167 --> 00:10:33.750
I specialized in the study
of sports dynamics and sorcery.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:37.292
I am as good at
curses as I am at sports.

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:40.125
As a matter of fact,
my success rate is 92%!

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:42.958
I-Is a sportsman allowed to curse people?!

00:10:42.958 --> 00:10:46.208
The true world of competition is a
place where rules have no meaning.

00:10:46.208 --> 00:10:48.333
If you will not take the coaching job,

00:10:48.333 --> 00:10:50.125
I will curse the two of
you so that forevermore,

00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:52.417
when you go the bathroom,
there will be no toilet paper

00:10:52.417 --> 00:10:55.042
and you'll have to wipe
your butt with the color inserts

00:10:55.042 --> 00:10:58.292
from weekly magazines that
someone happened to leave behind.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.792
Well? What will it be?!

00:11:02.792 --> 00:11:04.583
Well?! Well?!

00:11:05.708 --> 00:11:08.958
Could that be why you
have an illness of the anus?

00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:13.958
I see!

00:11:13.958 --> 00:11:16.875
“If you wipe with color inserts
from weekly magazines...”

00:11:25.625 --> 00:11:31.125
<i>Janpai</i>, <i>janpai</i>, let's mix it up.
Let's mix it up forever and ever.

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:33.458
I see, so this is the baseball team.

00:11:33.458 --> 00:11:35.208
Quite a rough bunch.

00:11:35.208 --> 00:11:36.667
You dummy!

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:38.250
Well, sorry!

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.375
What's the point
of just mixing the tiles?!

00:11:41.375 --> 00:11:44.958
Our brains aren't able to
memorize any rules beyond that!

00:11:44.958 --> 00:11:45.917
You idiot!

00:11:45.917 --> 00:11:49.042
Don't give up so easily!
I taught it to you the other day!

00:11:49.042 --> 00:11:50.833
The basics of Mahjong
lie in the All Straight Win!

00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:52.250
The All Straight Win is...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:56.208
Man, Mr. Aesop is unexpectedly
hot-blooded despite his looks.

00:11:56.208 --> 00:11:58.583
I'm sorry you had to see that,

00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:01.208
but this is really how the
baseball team is nowadays.

00:12:01.208 --> 00:12:03.667
But please don't misunderstand.

00:12:03.667 --> 00:12:09.333
Their passion for baseball is
as great as that of any other school.

00:12:09.333 --> 00:12:11.958
So, Miss Etchan, Miss Hatchan,

00:12:11.958 --> 00:12:15.250
please somehow give
them the will to try again.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.208
Well, I'm counting on you. Bye!

00:12:17.208 --> 00:12:20.083
And he's out of sight in no time at all!

00:12:20.083 --> 00:12:22.417
In the end, baseball team sponsors
and television anime directors

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:24.750
are quick to run!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.958
By the way, Mr. Aesop,
education starts with

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:32.500
just how you get close
to those naïve young hearts.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:36.083
Categorically yelling at them
produces the opposite effect.

00:12:36.083 --> 00:12:39.833
What we need on the modern
battlefield of education is...

00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:42.958
Yes! A glass of tomato juice!

00:12:42.958 --> 00:12:44.625
Here you go.

00:12:45.542 --> 00:12:48.292
T-Teacher, that's...

00:12:48.292 --> 00:12:51.208
Here you go,
have a glass of tomato juice.

00:12:52.042 --> 00:12:53.708
A glass of tomato juice...

00:12:53.708 --> 00:12:56.542
Teacher, we... we...

00:12:56.542 --> 00:12:57.958
Here you go.

00:12:57.958 --> 00:13:01.000
We'll do anything!

00:13:04.542 --> 00:13:06.375
Let's do it!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.583
"Dog"

00:13:11.583 --> 00:13:13.583
You all are dogs!

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:18.167
You all are elephants!

00:13:20.875 --> 00:13:23.042
You all are Sadaharu Oh!

00:13:25.208 --> 00:13:27.542
It's your bad luck
to have met up with us!

00:13:27.542 --> 00:13:29.750
Fried tofu skin!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:33.833
A-Amazing! I never dreamed
they'd become so tame.

00:13:33.833 --> 00:13:36.917
I kicked them, hit them,
and stuck needles under their nails,

00:13:36.917 --> 00:13:38.750
but nothing worked, and now...

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.583
But now that I look at it,
aren't we short on players?

00:13:41.583 --> 00:13:43.958
There are only eight of them.

00:13:43.958 --> 00:13:45.625
It seems that you have noticed.

00:13:45.625 --> 00:13:50.625
Yes, there is one other man
that must be called back to our team.

00:13:50.625 --> 00:13:52.583
Incidentally, who is that?

00:13:52.583 --> 00:13:55.167
He is the one who
holds the key to victory!

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:57.167
His name is Binbou!

00:13:58.792 --> 00:14:00.167
Got it.

00:14:01.333 --> 00:14:03.458
"Binbou - 17 yrs"

00:14:06.625 --> 00:14:08.958
Yukari-<i>chan</i>?

00:14:08.958 --> 00:14:10.292
Binbou...

00:14:11.708 --> 00:14:12.708
Aesop!

00:14:12.708 --> 00:14:16.417
Long time no see. You still
hanging out in places like this?

00:14:16.417 --> 00:14:18.125
Shut up!

00:14:18.125 --> 00:14:20.167
It's got nothing to do with you!

00:14:20.167 --> 00:14:23.458
Your Regent hairdo
is as annoying as ever.

00:14:24.458 --> 00:14:26.417
Is this Mr. Binbou?

00:14:26.417 --> 00:14:27.833
Yes, it is.

00:14:27.833 --> 00:14:30.333
So is his family poor after all?

00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:32.833
Oops, I dropped 500 million yen.

00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:34.500
No, they're super-rich.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.083
Then why?

00:14:36.083 --> 00:14:40.208
Well, that was during
the tournament in ninth grade.

00:14:40.208 --> 00:14:42.333
Oh, are we going for a flashback?

00:14:42.333 --> 00:14:45.667
Yes. We'll be going for seven cuts,
if it's not inconvenient.

00:14:45.667 --> 00:14:48.583
Not at all.
Please go on to the flashback.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.833
The decisive bottom of the ninth.

00:14:54.833 --> 00:14:57.292
His opponent was Sazae
of Hamaguri Junior High.

00:14:57.292 --> 00:14:59.833
The stands were in an uproar
over the greatest battle

00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:02.083
between a strong pitcher
and a strong batter!

00:15:03.042 --> 00:15:06.625
Watch next week too!

00:15:06.625 --> 00:15:11.208
But right then,
he threw a bean ball at Sazae!

00:15:11.208 --> 00:15:13.250
Maybe he lost his
momentum with that one pitch,

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:16.000
but in the end,
Hamaguri Junior High won the game.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.625
But I had seen through all that.

00:15:18.625 --> 00:15:20.875
If he has to compete
with them later at Koshien,

00:15:20.875 --> 00:15:23.208
it's better to crush
them now, rather than wait!

00:15:23.208 --> 00:15:27.375
That bean ball was
a bean ball for the future.

00:15:27.375 --> 00:15:30.208
What strategic thinking!
What great talent!

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:33.542
I was convinced! This was
a man that would go to Koshien!

00:15:33.542 --> 00:15:36.042
I needed him on my baseball team!

00:15:36.042 --> 00:15:38.750
Now, Binbou,
come back to the baseball team!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.875
There's no time to be
wallowing in pleasure here!

00:15:41.875 --> 00:15:44.958
Shut up! I've got no intention
of playing baseball again!

00:15:44.958 --> 00:15:45.750
What?!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.042
Why?! A man as good as you?!
Why, Binbou?!

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:51.417
My hand just slipped on that one pitch!

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:54.417
But you kept on yelling
about that bean ball,

00:15:54.417 --> 00:15:56.625
so I ended up being
treated like a total loser!

00:15:56.625 --> 00:15:59.208
Thanks to you,
I even got this nickname!

00:15:59.208 --> 00:16:02.208
What?! I never knew! I'm sorry!

00:16:02.208 --> 00:16:04.083
Sorry doesn't cut it, you idiot!

00:16:04.083 --> 00:16:07.000
Then hit me! Beat me up
until you're satisfied!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.500
You've got guts.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.667
Take that!

00:16:09.667 --> 00:16:11.167
Warefell!

00:16:12.458 --> 00:16:13.792
Yukari...

00:16:13.792 --> 00:16:16.583
Never show your
face before me again.

00:16:16.583 --> 00:16:17.917
Wait!

00:16:19.917 --> 00:16:21.750
W-Who are you?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.917
Popularly known
as Etchan and Hatchan.

00:16:23.917 --> 00:16:26.000
Baseball team coaches
for a limited time only!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.083
And what do you want with me?

00:16:28.083 --> 00:16:30.625
I've heard your story.
I understood most of it.

00:16:30.625 --> 00:16:32.958
But if you think about it,
that's the past.

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:37.625
Isn't what you young people
need the so-called future?

00:16:39.625 --> 00:16:42.917
Please take a look at this photo.

00:16:42.917 --> 00:16:44.125
That photo is...

00:16:44.125 --> 00:16:46.125
Everyone in the baseball
team is training intensively

00:16:46.125 --> 00:16:48.583
for the continuance of the team.

00:16:48.583 --> 00:16:53.000
Because if they lose the game
on Sunday, they will be dissolved.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.333
Dissolved?

00:16:56.292 --> 00:16:58.458
We are at Inu-nabe
High School's baseball field,

00:16:58.458 --> 00:17:00.167
blessed by a clear sky.

00:17:00.167 --> 00:17:04.458
The practice game with Sarutama
High School is about to begin!

00:17:04.458 --> 00:17:07.042
I am your host, Live Broadcast.

00:17:07.042 --> 00:17:07.958
--And our commentator is...

00:17:07.958 --> 00:17:08.958
--I'm Nabeshin.
--And our commentator is...

00:17:08.958 --> 00:17:10.667
Mr. Akio Ohsugi, shop owner of
Anna Miller's in Shibuya,

00:17:10.667 --> 00:17:13.667
parenthesis, a lie, thank you
for everything, as always.

00:17:13.667 --> 00:17:15.083
He ain't listening.

00:17:15.083 --> 00:17:17.417
Mr. Binbou hasn't shown up.

00:17:17.417 --> 00:17:19.667
He'll come. He'll come for sure.

00:17:19.667 --> 00:17:22.625
As a sportsman. No, as a person.

00:17:22.625 --> 00:17:26.333
Oh, by the way, are you sure it's
okay for me to be on the team?

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:30.000
It's okay. If you stay quiet,
I'm sure no one will notice.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.000
Those words fall far short
of the ideal of sportsmanship.

00:17:36.125 --> 00:17:38.042
M-Monkeys?!

00:17:38.042 --> 00:17:39.750
Exactly! That is the veteran
team from this prefecture,

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.583
the Sarutama High School
Baseball Team!

00:17:41.583 --> 00:17:44.000
T-T-T-They're monkeys,
no matter how you look at them!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.458
You must not underestimate them.

00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:46.500
They might not look it,

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.833
but they made it to the
top eight at Koshien last year.

00:17:48.833 --> 00:17:50.500
Get your act together, humans.

00:17:50.875 --> 00:17:52.917
Meanwhile, Binbou was...

00:18:00.708 --> 00:18:04.458
Hi, my name is Hyuu-<i>chan</i>.
You want to go to Koshien too?

00:18:04.458 --> 00:18:07.875
Then let's sing!

00:18:07.875 --> 00:18:10.542
Meanwhile, Excel was...

00:18:10.542 --> 00:18:13.208
It has finally begun!
The battle in the spotlight!

00:18:13.208 --> 00:18:16.208
I look forward to seeing
Sarutama's wild plays.

00:18:16.208 --> 00:18:19.542
Heave! Heave! Heave ho heave! No!

00:18:19.542 --> 00:18:23.375
As mankind and as the species
human, I can't lose to monkeys!

00:18:23.375 --> 00:18:25.250
It must not be!

00:18:30.708 --> 00:18:32.333
Out!

00:18:32.333 --> 00:18:35.250
The monkeys are nonchalantly strong.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.250
Is it no good after all?

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.833
I won't lose!
This time, I'm up at bat!

00:18:42.333 --> 00:18:45.542
She hit it! It's going,
it's going! This is big!

00:18:45.542 --> 00:18:47.083
No, it's not going.

00:18:47.083 --> 00:18:48.583
What?! Why?!

00:18:48.583 --> 00:18:50.250
The scope of Sarutama High
School's defense

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:52.833
is truly three times
that of humans.

00:18:52.833 --> 00:18:54.708
I see!

00:18:54.708 --> 00:18:57.250
M-M-M-M-Monkey magic?!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.167
A croissant?

00:19:04.917 --> 00:19:07.583
Man, I can't stand
watching our baseball team.

00:19:07.583 --> 00:19:09.750
Maybe they went to Koshien,
but they're monkeys.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.125
They should just throw
millet dumplings at them.

00:19:12.125 --> 00:19:13.792
Hey, wait!

00:19:14.125 --> 00:19:16.917
Quit babbling that nonsense!

00:19:16.917 --> 00:19:20.167
Koshien and baseball...

00:19:20.167 --> 00:19:22.542
...aren't that easy!

00:19:26.542 --> 00:19:29.792
Can you believe it?! In a blink
of an eye, it's already the ninth!

00:19:29.792 --> 00:19:31.000
It's too fast!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:35.125
Inu-nabe's pitcher
has finally been cornered!

00:19:35.125 --> 00:19:38.000
Two outs, bases loaded.
The batter is Sarunosuke Saruta.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.708
The main gun is
afraid to fire this once!

00:19:39.708 --> 00:19:40.667
"Come..."

00:19:40.917 --> 00:19:41.958
--Lululu, I'm tired.
--Senior...

00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:43.583
--Lululu, I'm tired.
--It's no good, her exhaustion has peaked.

00:19:43.583 --> 00:19:45.083
--Lalala, my legs are stiff and tired.
--It's no good, her exhaustion has peaked.

00:19:45.083 --> 00:19:46.125
--It's no good, her exhaustion has peaked.

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:52.250
Stiff shoulders, lower
backache, sore muscles...

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.625
Him...

00:19:53.625 --> 00:19:54.542
Senior...

00:19:54.542 --> 00:19:56.333
Him...

00:19:56.333 --> 00:19:57.667
Him!

00:20:04.792 --> 00:20:06.125
What?!

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:15.583
Binbou!

00:20:15.583 --> 00:20:16.167
Binbou!

00:20:16.167 --> 00:20:16.417
Binbou! Binbou!

00:20:16.417 --> 00:20:16.917
Binbou! Binbou!

00:20:16.917 --> 00:20:17.833
Binbou!

00:20:17.833 --> 00:20:19.500
What the hell is this?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.792
Trade places with me.

00:20:21.792 --> 00:20:25.208
I'm the only one
who can guard the mound.

00:20:25.208 --> 00:20:27.750
I'll let you have the good part.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.708
The pitcher has been relieved!

00:20:30.708 --> 00:20:34.083
What kind of pitch will
Binbou throw at this critical moment?!

00:20:35.958 --> 00:20:38.542
I've taken a huge detour to get here.

00:20:38.542 --> 00:20:41.792
But in the end, this is where I belong!

00:20:50.042 --> 00:20:54.833
100 to 0. The game has ended
with the expected wide-margin win.

00:20:54.833 --> 00:20:58.208
Mr. Nabeshin,
thank you very much for today.

00:20:58.208 --> 00:21:00.000
But he's asleep.

00:21:04.875 --> 00:21:06.042
Teacher...

00:21:06.042 --> 00:21:07.375
Don't say anything.

00:21:07.375 --> 00:21:10.042
B-But I...

00:21:10.042 --> 00:21:12.125
You came back.

00:21:12.125 --> 00:21:14.500
Today is our play ball.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.542
That's exactly right, Binbou!

00:21:16.542 --> 00:21:17.875
E-Everyone...

00:21:17.875 --> 00:21:19.292
Welcome back, Binbou.

00:21:19.292 --> 00:21:20.583
Welcome back.

00:21:20.583 --> 00:21:22.750
Welcome back, Binbou.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.417
Look, Binbou's crying!

00:21:24.417 --> 00:21:27.083
You idiot! Tears are the heart's sap!

00:21:27.083 --> 00:21:28.417
Everyone...

00:21:28.417 --> 00:21:31.083
Young Master! It's terrible!

00:21:31.083 --> 00:21:34.417
I just received news that your
father's company went bankrupt!

00:21:37.042 --> 00:21:40.000
Now you're an
honest to goodness Binbou.

00:21:51.292 --> 00:21:52.333
Wanna go home?

00:21:52.333 --> 00:21:54.583
A job well done, Senior.

00:21:54.583 --> 00:22:01.583
"Youth is a bewildering road, but its
destination always leads to friends..."

00:22:02.458 --> 00:22:06.958
"Episode 11: Butt Out, Youth!"

00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:08.875
"Episode 11: Butt Out, Youth!"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:08.875 --> 00:22:10.708
"Episode 11: Butt Out, Youth!"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.958
Hey...

00:22:14.958 --> 00:22:16.875
May I ask something?

00:22:17.667 --> 00:22:21.333
Since I laid my hands on
Ms. Will, where are you taking me?

00:22:22.333 --> 00:22:23.625
Tokyo Bay.

00:22:23.625 --> 00:22:28.458
No!

00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:59.500
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:06.875
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.875 --> 00:23:15.000
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:32.500
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:40.375
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.375 --> 00:23:48.250
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:57.042
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.792 --> 00:24:01.333
Ring, ring, ring!
Hello? Investigations.

00:24:01.333 --> 00:24:03.000
What?! Murder?!
Mr. Yama, go to the site with Nabeshin.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.500
Nekomimi, Inumayuge, and
Hanabuta, go snoop for information!

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:07.250
Majesty, Highness, and My Queen,
look into their relationship!

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:08.083
You never hear such communications
with the boss anymore.

00:24:08.083 --> 00:24:10.333
You never hear such communications
with the boss anymore.

00:24:10.333 --> 00:24:12.667
City shootings and car chases
have disappeared from television.

00:24:12.667 --> 00:24:14.583
Wanna eat cutlets on rice?
Oh, your mom's crying.

00:24:14.583 --> 00:24:15.583
Oh, where did they go?

00:24:15.583 --> 00:24:18.292
Where did those unrealistic,
but Ishihara-spirited detectives go?

00:24:18.292 --> 00:24:20.208
If no one's going to do it,
then Excel will!

00:24:20.208 --> 00:24:22.042
Bring those glorious detective
stories to the living room!

00:24:22.042 --> 00:24:24.417
Non-dancing, non-continuing,
non-dangerous detectives will flit about.

00:24:24.417 --> 00:24:25.583
Next time: “Big City Part II”

00:24:25.583 --> 00:24:28.594
Of course, there is no Part I.
